### 1. 商户创建订单（正常下单）
POST http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M10001",
  "merchantOrderNo": "M20260621001",
  "subject": "手机充值100元",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "callbackUrl": "https://merchant-demo.com/pay/callback"
}

### 2. 商户创建订单（不传callback，使用商户默认回调）
POST http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M10001",
  "merchantOrderNo": "M20260621002",
  "subject": "会员月度套餐",
  "amount": 29.90,
  "callbackUrl": ""
}

### 3. 商户创建订单-幂等测试（重复外部商户单号，直接返回已有订单）
POST http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M10001",
  "merchantOrderNo": "M20260621001",
  "subject": "手机充值100元",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "callbackUrl": "https://merchant-demo.com/pay/callback"
}

### 4. 创建订单参数校验失败（金额0元，@DecimalMin("0.01")）
POST http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M10001",
  "merchantOrderNo": "M20260621003",
  "subject": "测试商品",
  "amount": 0.00,
  "callbackUrl": ""
}

### 5. 创建订单-非法商户号（不存在商户，抛 MERCHANT_NOT_FOUND）
POST http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M99999",
  "merchantOrderNo": "M20260621004",
  "subject": "测试商品",
  "amount": 9.90,
  "callbackUrl": ""
}

### 6. 查询商户全部订单（不传status）
GET http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders?merchantNo=M10001

### 7. 查询商户指定状态订单（待支付 PENDING）
GET http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders?merchantNo=M10001&status=PENDING

### 8. 查询商户指定状态订单（已支付 PAID）
GET http://localhost:8104/api/merchant/orders?merchantNo=M10001&status=PAID

### 9. 订单详情查询接口1 order-service /api/orders/{orderNo}
# 替换下方 P20260621xxxx 为真实创建返回的 orderNo
GET http://localhost:8102/api/orders/P20260621190255BDF9ED31

### 10. 订单详情查询接口2 /api/pay/orders/{orderNo}
GET http://localhost:8102/api/pay/orders/P20260621190255BDF9ED31

### 11. 查询不存在的订单（返回 ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
GET http://localhost:8102/api/orders/P99999999999999999999

